<title>USA: Department 56 names president/COO Engel CEO.</title>
<headline>Department 56 names president/COO Engel CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, Minn. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Department 56 Inc said Wednesday that President and Chief Operating Officer Susan Engel had been named to the additional position of chief executive.</p>
<p>She succeeds company founder Ed Bazinet, who will remain chairman of the board and who will concentrate on the creative development of the company's giftware line.</p>
<p>Department 56 is a designer, importer and distributor of collectibles and other specialty giftwares.</p>
</text>
